--!nonstrict
--[[
	Collect Cards Hub
	-----------------
	A single-file helper for [Collect Cards] with five tools:

	  1. Tycoon  - buys your shop upgrade pads for you (instant by default, walking if needed)
	  2. Shop    - buys card packs and Building furniture, with pick-lists and a spend priority
	  3. Tower   - plays the Battle Tower for you on the tower you choose
	  4. Packs   - opens every pack in your inventory
	  5. Dupes   - sells extra copies of cards you already own

	Press RightControl to hide or show the window.
	Every switch is off when the script starts, so nothing happens until you turn it on.
	Settings, theme and toggles are saved in the CollectCardsHub folder.
]]

